        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/agent/human-coder-2> ;
    nuproc:generatedQualityMeasurement <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/qm/counterparty-ok-coder1>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/qm/counterparty-ok-coder2>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/qm/event-validity-coder1>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/qm/event-validity-coder2>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/qm/merge-correct-coder1>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/qm/merge-correct-coder2>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/qm/player-ok-coder1>,
