<https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/validation/occurrence_validation> a nuproc:ValidationActivity ;
    rdfs:label "Occurrence-status validation (stratified sample of 150 design clusters)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "150 design clusters drawn stratified by the model's occurrence status (VALIDATION_PROTOCOL section 1 of occurrence protocol v1). Two human coders coded the occurrence status separately, blind to the model coding, the strata and each other (as asked; not verifiable); the author adjudicated the clusters on which they disagreed, without the model's values and before seeing the comparison with the model. The adjudicated reference gives the final occurrence status of the sampled clusters. The scoring script was committed before the coders' sheets were read (scripts/score_occurrence_v1.py)."@en ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/agent/occurrence-validation-coder-A>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/agent/occurrence-validation-coder-B>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/agent/rule-author> ;
    nuproc:generatedQualityMeasurement <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/qm/occurrence-kappa-A-B>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/qm/occurrence-kappa-A-model>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/qm/occurrence-kappa-B-model>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/qm/occurrence-kappa-reference-model> .

