<https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/activity/candidate_set_resolution_validation> a prov:Activity ;
    rdfs:label "blind review of the candidate-set determinations by the author"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The author judged all 197 candidate-set events again from the article excerpts, blind to the model's determinations and to the event identifiers (VALIDATION_PROTOCOL section 1); 195 agreed with the model coding. Where they differed, the author set the final value after seeing both. Each blind judgement is a resolution claim generated by this review; it is the final claim where the final value differs from the model's determination (ADR-0043). The agreement figures are in evaluation/coding/v3.0/validation/."@en ;
    prov:qualifiedAssociation <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/activity/candidate_set_resolution_validation/association/protocol> ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/agent/rule-author> ;
    prov:wasInformedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/activity/engagement_role_coding_v3> .

