    rdfs:label "adjudicated human reference for the occurrence status of the sampled clusters"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The human reference for the occurrence status of the 150 sampled clusters (VALIDATION_PROTOCOL section 2.3): the value on which the two coders agreed, or the author's decision from the excerpts where they disagreed or a value was missing, made without the model's values. Its claims are the final occurrence claims of the sampled clusters, and each is derived from the claims of the coders who gave the same value (prov:wasDerivedFrom). The model's claims for these clusters remain as claims that were not adopted (ADR-0041)."@en ;
