<https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/qm/occurrence-kappa-A-B> a nuproc:DataQualityMeasurement ;
    rdfs:label "Occurrence-status agreement between the validation coders"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Sample n=150 drawn stratified by the model's value, so the kappa is a sample statistic, not a population one. Computed by scripts/score_occurrence_v1.py (committed before the coders' sheets were read). Per-value precision and recall with stratum weights and the population estimates are in evaluation/coding/occurrence_v1/validation/."@en ;
    dqv:computedOn <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/entity/occurrence-validation-A-output>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/entity/occurrence-validation-B-output> ;
    dqv:isMeasurementOf <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/metric/cohen_kappa_nominal> ;
    dqv:value 0.703 ;
    nuproc:appliesToLayer nuproc:EngagementCluster ;
    nuproc:comparisonType "validation coder A vs validation coder B, before adjudication, stratified sample of 150 design clusters, unweighted, rare values oversampled"^^xsd:string ;
    nuproc:hasSampleSize "150"^^xsd:positiveInteger ;
    nuproc:measuresProperty nuproc:hasOccurrenceStatus .

<https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/qm/occurrence-kappa-A-model> a nuproc:DataQualityMeasurement ;
    rdfs:label "Occurrence-status agreement, validation coder A vs the model coding"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Sample n=150 drawn stratified by the model's value, so the kappa is a sample statistic, not a population one. Computed by scripts/score_occurrence_v1.py (committed before the coders' sheets were read). Per-value precision and recall with stratum weights and the population estimates are in evaluation/coding/occurrence_v1/validation/."@en ;
    dqv:computedOn <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/entity/occurrence-model-output>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/entity/occurrence-validation-A-output> ;
    dqv:isMeasurementOf <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/metric/cohen_kappa_nominal> ;
    dqv:value 0.786 ;
    nuproc:appliesToLayer nuproc:EngagementCluster ;
    nuproc:comparisonType "validation coder A vs the occurrence model coding (claude-opus-5-5), stratified sample of 150 design clusters, unweighted, rare values oversampled"^^xsd:string ;
    nuproc:hasSampleSize "150"^^xsd:positiveInteger ;
    nuproc:measuresProperty nuproc:hasOccurrenceStatus .

<https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/qm/occurrence-kappa-B-model> a nuproc:DataQualityMeasurement ;
    rdfs:label "Occurrence-status agreement, validation coder B vs the model coding"@en ;
