<https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/activity/engagement_role_validation_coding_A> a nuproc:EngagementRoleCodingActivity ;
    rdfs:label "engagement role validation coding (codebook v3.0) by human coder A"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Coding of the engagement roles of the export-side actor in a stratified sample of 150 design events by one human coder (a graduate student), under the rules the model coding followed (coding protocol v3 sections 2-3, codebook v3.0), asked to work blind to the model coding and the other coder and without AI tools (VALIDATION_PROTOCOL section 2.2; not verifiable). Each value is a role claim of this coding and is not final: in the sampled events the asserted values are those of the adjudicated reference, generated by a separate activity. The coder is not named."@en ;
    prov:qualifiedAssociation <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/activity/engagement_role_validation_coding_A/association/codebook> ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/agent/role-validation-coder-A> ;
    nuproc:usedCodebookVersion <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/codebook/v3.0> .

<https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/activity/engagement_role_validation_coding_B> a nuproc:EngagementRoleCodingActivity ;
    rdfs:label "engagement role validation coding (codebook v3.0) by human coder B"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Coding of the engagement roles of the export-side actor in a stratified sample of 150 design events by one human coder (a graduate student), under the rules the model coding followed (coding protocol v3 sections 2-3, codebook v3.0), asked to work blind to the model coding and the other coder and without AI tools (VALIDATION_PROTOCOL section 2.2; not verifiable). Each value is a role claim of this coding and is not final: in the sampled events the asserted values are those of the adjudicated reference, generated by a separate activity. The coder is not named."@en ;
    prov:qualifiedAssociation <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/activity/engagement_role_validation_coding_B/association/codebook> ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/agent/role-validation-coder-B> ;
    nuproc:usedCodebookVersion <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/codebook/v3.0> .

<https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/activity/occurrence_validation_coding_A> a nuproc:CodingActivity ;
    rdfs:label "occurrence status validation coding by human coder A"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Coding of the occurrence status in a stratified sample of 150 design clusters by one human coder (a graduate student), under the rules the model coding followed (occurrence coding protocol v1, sections 2-3, and its codebook), asked to work blind to the model coding, the strata, the event identifiers and the other coder and without AI tools (VALIDATION_PROTOCOL section 2.1; not verifiable). Each value is an occurrence claim of this coding and is not final. The coder is not named."@en ;
    prov:qualifiedAssociation <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/activity/occurrence_validation_coding_A/association/codebook> ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/agent/occurrence-validation-coder-A> ;
    nuproc:usedCodebookVersion <https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/codebook/occurrence_v1> .

