<https://w3id.org/nuproc/demo/agent/rule-author> a prov:Person ;
    rdfs:label "Author"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The author of this work: decided the candidate-set determinations that coding protocol v3 left to the author, reviewed all candidate-set events blind, re-judged those left undetermined, and adjudicated the two validation samples (ADR-0040, ADR-0041)."@en .

